  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Health and Protection to Vulnerable Migrants Transiting through Morocco, Tunisia, Egypt, Libya, Yemen and Sudan (Phase III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging on the project achievements thus far and by expanding to Sudan, the 3rd phase aims to improve vulnerable migrants&apos; health and wellbeing, and to advance towards universal health coverage (UHC) in Morocco, Tunisia, Egypt, Libya, Yemen and Sudan. The project will emphasize on strengthening the capacity of the respective countries&apos; Ministries of Health (MoH) and local responders, in jointly managing migration flow with a focus on improving public health promotion and protection for all in safe, post-conflict and conflict settings.</narrative>
  </description>
